## Scope

Instrument native SDT phase and memory costs on bounded Palgrave subsets in
an isolated profile. Do not overwrite production caches or equate a quiet
progress bar with a failed extraction.

## Evidence

- Report: `verification/SDT-PALGRAVE-PHASES.md`.
- Raw/derived evidence: `bench/results/sdt-palgrave-phases-2026-09-05/`.
- Producer: `verification/probes/sdt_phase_probe.py` and
  `verification/probes/sdt-phase-harness/`.
- Summary: `verification/probes/sdt_phase_summary.py`.
- Instrumentation guards: `tests/test_sdt_phase_instrumentation.py`.

## Exit criteria

- [x] Verify isolated process resource caps and unchanged source bytes.
- [x] Measure page, global-reference and pack phases on progressively larger subsets.
- [x] Compare an unmodified-worker control on identical input.
- [x] Distinguish measured long progress silence from a hang and name full-volume limits.
